      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY\nCOMMISSIONING OF THE NEWLY PROVIDED ENGINEERING INFRASTRUCTURE IN WUYE DISTRICT\nDay 20 -Tuesday 21st October, 2025\n\nThe FCT motoring public are informed of the above mentioned project to be commissioned on Olusegun Obasanjo Way, near Shafa Filling Station in Wuye.\n\nAs such, vehicular traffic near the traffic lights will be restricted with visible road diversion signals.\n\nAlternative Route:\n\nTraffic will be diverted to Reuben Okoya Street to connect\n\nOlusegun Obasanjo Way by Exclusive Hotel.\nTraffic and security personnel will be deployed accordingly to ensure seamless movement of dignitaries and avoid gridlock within and around the venue.\n\nThe cooperation of the motoring public is highly solicited.\n\nSigned\nHead Traffic, DRTS",
